<view class="page picker-page">
  <view class="eyebrow">CITY POINT</view>
  <view class="title">标记所在城市</view>
  <view class="subtitle intro">填写城市名称，再拖动地图，让十字落在城市附近。保存的是城市代表点。</view>
  <view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!hasOpener}}">请从人物资料编辑页打开城市地图，选好的城市才能带回人物卡。<button class="btn secondary" bindtap="onBackHome">返回我的圈子</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
  <view class="card name-card">
    <label class="field"><text class="field-label">城市 *</text><input class="field-control" value="{{city}}" placeholder="例如：奥斯陆" maxlength="40" data-field="city" bindinput="onInput" /></label>
    <label class="field"><text class="field-label">国家 / 地区 *</text><input class="field-control" value="{{country}}" placeholder="例如：挪威" maxlength="40" data-field="country" bindinput="onInput" /></label>
    <label class="field"><text class="field-label">省 / 州（可选）</text><input class="field-control" value="{{province}}" placeholder="例如：广东" maxlength="40" data-field="province" bindinput="onInput" /></label>
  </view>
  <view class="region-row">
    <view class="region-chip" wx:for="{{regions}}" wx:key="label" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRegion">{{item.label}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="map-frame">
    <map id="cityMap" class="picker-map" latitude="{{latitude}}" longitude="{{longitude}}" scale="{{scale}}" show-location="{{false}}" enable-scroll="{{true}}" enable-zoom="{{true}}" enable-rotate="{{false}}" enable-overlooking="{{false}}" />
    <cover-view class="crosshair">＋</cover-view>
  </view>
  <view class="map-caption">拖动或缩放地图，把十字移到城市中心附近</view>
  <view class="card privacy-note">不会读取你的实时位置。保存前会把地图位置取整到约 10 公里精度；请不要标记家庭住址。</view>
  <view class="sticky-bottom"><button class="btn" disabled="{{selecting}}" bindtap="onConfirm">{{selecting ? '正在确认…' : '确认这个城市'}}</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
